                                "sense_id": "8b6fda8f-603b-3515-96ed-07efe84ee02c",
                                "text": "An aptness to learn is more observable in some children than in others."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a88b53cf-9d18-3ab5-8aec-e64d5efb3ad6",
